    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Niall Browne & Co , Real Estate Agents are delighted to present 102 Gleann na Rí.\r\n\r\nIt is located in Murrough which is found in the Merlin Park area of Galway city. The estate is located within 4 km east of Galway City Centre with easy reach of Atlantic Technological University (ATU), Merlin Park Hospital, Bon Secours Hospital, and Ballyloughane Beach. The area is well serviced by good transport links to Galway City Centre and Parkmore Business Park.\r\n\r\n102 Gleann na Rí is a spacious two-bedroom second-floor apartment extending to approximately 64 sq.m in size and is extremely bright and airy due to it favourable south-westerly aspect. exceptionally well-appointed accommodation, ideally suited for owner-occupiers, investors, or students attending ATU Galway. This very attractive wo-bedroom apartment comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, bathroom, hotpress, two double bedrooms, and an open-plan kitchen, dining and living room. The property benefits from exceptional brightness throughout and creates a bright, inviting living space.\r\n\r\nThis property is ideal for first time buyers, small families, or passive investors seeking modern, well-maintained accommodation. For investors, this apartment falls outside the Pooled Rental System and can be privately managed. Key Features Spacious second-floor apartment extending to 64  sq.m. Two generously-sized double bedrooms with fitted units Open-plan kitchen, dining and living area Entrance hallway, bathroom and hotpress Electric heating throughout Communal parking and large landscaped green spaces Recreational facilities including tennis and soccer courts Ideal for first time buyers, small families, or passive investors Management & Investment Information Management Company: Ocean Property Mgmt Management Fee: Approx €1,884.12 per annum Investors: This apartment falls outside the Pooled Rental System and can be privately managed.\r\n\r\nThe development includes landscaped green spaces and recreational facilities. Located in a well-established residential area with excellent transport connections to Galway City Centre and surrounding business parks. Highly recommended for viewing."
      },
